  Description: Prerequisite Region - Impossible Lands Staying alive among the scheming,
    ravenous undead of Geb required a deep knowledge of their motivations, capabilities,
    and weaknesses. More often than not, it also required the ability to weave alibis
    and life-preserving half-truths capable of swaying a stilled heart. Choose two
    attribute boosts. One must be to Charisma or Constitution , and one is a free
    attribute boost. You're trained in the Deception skill and the Undead Lore skill.
    You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Charming Liar] skill feat.
